  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself or a loved one in faith and comfort with this personalized Christian blanket from Jeminise. This inspirational blanket is designed to provide warmth, peace, and daily encouragement, making it a heartfelt keepsake for believers and a meaningful gift for special occasions.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational religious throw blanket perfect for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms, offering beautiful bible verse gifts for women and girls.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add a name or date to create a one-of-a-kind Jesus Christ blanket, a cherished item for faith-filled homes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from skin-friendly fleece fabric, blending comfort with scripture for prayer and quiet time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features an uplifting design with butterflies, floral elements, clouds, and crosses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Includes two text input options for personalization.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses For Product</th>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
